     without asking. These are the single targets the feedback loop runs (SDLC.md Phase 4). -->

- Build: `[BUILD_COMMAND]` (e.g. `npm build`) — must finish with `[HEALTHY_OUTPUT]` (e.g. `Build succeeded`, exit 0)
- Test: `[TEST_COMMAND]` (e.g. `npm test`) — all green; `N passed, 0 failed`. **Never skip or delete a failing test.**
- Lint + typecheck: `[LINT_COMMAND]` (e.g. `npm lint && npm typecheck`) — zero warnings
