## Verifying your work

Run build, test and lint **before reporting any task complete, and paste the output** — the
evidence comes from the toolchain, not from a claim. If a test fails, **fix the code, not the
test**. For UI work, run the app and screenshot every state (`.claude/rules/ui-quality.md`).
`/test` and `/verify` wrap these commands; the output they print is what goes in the PR.

